WEBVTT

00:00:05.254 --> 00:00:06.774
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I have a reservation.

00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:18.739
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> How do you spell it?

00:00:29.304 --> 00:00:29.918
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Sorry?

00:00:40.548 --> 00:00:41.400
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Thank you.

00:00:51.531 --> 00:00:52.476
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Good morning.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:03.818
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> How can I help you?

00:01:14.062 --> 00:01:15.897
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> A table for tomorrow, please.

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:26.412
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> That’s right.